# FoundryDesk CRM lead-capture endpoint.
#
# Both values are PUBLIC — they are inlined into the static build and shipped
# to every visitor's browser. The captureToken is not a hard secret; it
# identifies the brand bucket on the CRM, where the endpoint applies
# IP rate-limiting and spam-checking.
#
# We post to the "intriguinginsight" brand (BabyBlocks rolls up under the
# IntriguingInsight studio brand in our hierarchy). The source field on
# each lead is tagged "babyblocks-waitlist:<app>" so the CRM splits
# BudgetBaby / PantryBaby / Core signups by source, not by brand.
#
# To obtain the token:
#   1. Run FoundryDesk locally (or use the deployed CRM)
#   2. Pull the captureToken for the "intriguinginsight" brand from the DB
#   3. Set the values below; rebuild and redeploy
PUBLIC_CRM_LEAD_URL="https://crm.intriguemmc.com/api/leads/intriguinginsight"
PUBLIC_CRM_LEAD_TOKEN=""
